      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE MISS MORGAN (10) had a favourable gate and was too good at Kilmore two runs ago. Drew wide last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 85 metres into seventh at Melton over 1720m. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Leading hope if anywhere near her best. PASS THE SALT (3) finished fifth last start, beaten 35 metres at Melton over 1720m. Expect him to be prominent. DISTANT SUN (6) is a consistent performer with three top-three finishes on the trot. Only needs things to fall his way and the good recent form can convert to a well-deserved win. DOSSIER (1) is next best and gets every chance from a favourable draw.",
